   "q": 298,
   "before": null,
   "after": "①$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{11}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{11}}{\\sqrt{11}\\times\\sqrt{11}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{11}}{11} 3\\sqrt{2}$ ②$\\frac{6}{\\sqrt{8}}=\\frac{6}{2\\sqrt{2}}=\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{2}}=\\frac{3\\times\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{2}\\times\\sqrt{2}}= 2$ ③$\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3\\sqrt{5}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}\\times\\sqrt{5}}{3\\sqrt{5}\\times\\sqrt{5}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{15} 3 3\\times\\sqrt{7}$ ④ $= =\\frac{3\\sqrt{7}}{28} 4\\sqrt{7} 4\\sqrt{7}\\times\\sqrt{7} 5\\sqrt{11} 5\\sqrt{11}\\times\\sqrt{2}$ ⑤ $=\\frac{5\\sqrt{11}}{4\\sqrt{2}}= =\\frac{5\\sqrt{22}}{8} \\sqrt{32} 4\\sqrt{2}\\times\\sqrt{2}$ 따라서 옳지 않은 것은 ④이다."
  },
  {
   "id": "e016b89a-f1f9-4b78-912c-d44af25366bc",
