  {
   "id": "e48325d8-bb43-40bf-89dd-63e36d0615bb",
   "field": "solution",
   "book": "RPM 중학 3-1 학생용.pdf",
   "q": 300,
   "before": null,
   "after": "$\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{\\sqrt{7}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{5}\\times\\sqrt{7}}{\\sqrt{7}\\times\\sqrt{7}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{35}}{7} \\sqrt{7}=\\frac{7\\sqrt{7}}{7}=\\frac{\\sqrt{34} 3}{7} \\frac{5}{\\sqrt{7}}=\\frac{5\\times\\sqrt{7}}{\\sqrt{7}\\times\\sqrt{7}}=\\frac{5\\sqrt{7}}{7}=\\frac{\\sqrt{17} 5}{7} \\frac{5}{7}=\\frac{\\sqrt{25}}{7}$ 이므로 큰 것부터 차례대로 나열하면 $\\sqrt{7},\\frac{5}{\\sqrt{7}},\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{\\sqrt{7}},\\frac{5}{7}, \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{7}$ 따라서 두 번째에 오는 수는$\\frac{5}{\\sqrt{7}}$이다."
  },
  {
   "id": "7422c5cb-63c3-4d5e-a477-223377c18fbe",
   "field": "solution",
   "book": "RPM 중학 3-1 학생용.pdf",
   "q": 323,
   "before": null,
   "after": "$\\overline{AP}=\\overline{AC}=\\sqrt{1^{2}+1^{2}}=\\sqrt{2}$이므로 $p=-2+\\sqrt{2} \\overline{BQ}=\\overline{BD}=\\sqrt{1^{2}+1^{2}}=\\sqrt{2}$이므로 $q=-1-\\sqrt{2}$ ∴$p-q =(-2+\\sqrt{2})-(-1-\\sqrt{2}) =-2+\\sqrt{2}+1+\\sqrt{2} =-1+2\\sqrt{2}$"
  },
  {
   "id": "4dea31e6-9360-4aea-ad9a-8d5e15ef0f8f",
   "field": "solution",
   "book": "RPM 중학 3-1 학생용.pdf",
   "q": 318,
   "before": null,
   "after": "$\\sqrt{125}-\\frac{\\sqrt{90}}{\\sqrt{2}}+\\frac{6}{\\sqrt{3}}-\\sqrt{27} =5\\sqrt{5}-\\sqrt{45}+\\frac{6\\sqrt{3}}{3}-3\\sqrt{3} =5\\sqrt{5}-3\\sqrt{5}+2\\sqrt{3}-3\\sqrt{3} =-\\sqrt{3}+2\\sqrt{5}$"
  },
  {
   "id": "83309528-359c-405b-a551-4d71e0099ed5",
   "field": "solution",
   "book": "RPM 중학 3-1 학생용.pdf",
   "q": 322,
   "before": null,
   "after": "$\\overline{AP}=\\overline{AB}=\\sqrt{1^{2}+2^{2}}=\\sqrt{5}$이므로 $p=2+\\sqrt{5} \\overline{AQ}=\\overline{AD}=\\sqrt{2^{2}+1^{2}}=\\sqrt{5}$이므로 $q=2-\\sqrt{5}$ ∴$2p-q =2(2+\\sqrt{5})-(2-\\sqrt{5}) =4+2\\sqrt{5}-2+\\sqrt{5} =2+3\\sqrt{5}$"
  },
  {
   "id": "73a40a49-6521-47e3-a615-9101e44642e4",
   "field": "solution",
   "book": "RPM 중학 3-1 학생용.pdf",
   "q": 329,
   "before": null,
   "after": "(주어진 식)$=\\frac{(2\\sqrt{3}-\\sqrt{2} )\\times\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{2}\\times\\sqrt{2}}-\\frac{(3\\sqrt{2}+\\sqrt{3} )\\times\\sqrt{3}}{\\sqrt{3}\\times\\sqrt{3}} =\\frac{2\\sqrt{6}-2}{2}-\\frac{3\\sqrt{6}+3}{3} =\\sqrt{6}-1-\\sqrt{6}-1 =-2$"
  },
  {
   "id": "23e90f3d-bb64-4552-a3b7-f3503f36ace8",
   "field": "answer",
   "book": "RPM 중학 3-1 학생용.pdf",
