   "q": 47,
   "before": null,
   "after": "$\\overline{BC}=\\sqrt{2^{2}+4^{2}}=\\sqrt{20}=2\\sqrt{5}$ ① $\\sin  B=\\frac{\\overline{AC}}{\\overline{BC}}=\\frac{4}{2\\sqrt{5}}=\\frac{2\\sqrt{5}}{5}$ ② $\\cos  B=\\frac{\\overline{AB}}{\\overline{BC}}= 2 = \\sqrt{5} 2\\sqrt{5} 5$ ③ $\\sin  C=\\frac{\\overline{AB}}{\\overline{BC}}= 2 = \\sqrt{5} 2\\sqrt{5} 5$ ④ $\\cos  C=\\overline{AC}= 4 = 2\\sqrt{5} \\overline{BC} 2\\sqrt{5} 5$ ⑤ $\\tan  C=\\overline{AB}=\\frac{2}{4}=\\frac{1}{2} \\overline{AC}$ 따라서 옳은 것은 ③이다."
  },
  {
   "id": "f12f9bed-c70b-4f7d-b1bf-8411e432a59f",
